<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>CPP-API: <link linkend="_class_empty">Empty</link> logging implementation. </para>



<para>Does nothing! Used by default if the application hasn&apos;t requested a custom logger via <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_default_logger_1a9daba548026045b99813c760c2842ed2">DefaultLogger::set()</link> or <link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_default_logger_1aeba2d768f7549fb218bcce1245e88e1c">DefaultLogger::create()</link>; </para>
</section>
